/// M29 HISTORY-034 "Close preserves parent and peer: roots green".
/// Source: tests/support/tempcache/cache_test.go symbol
/// TestClosePreservesParentAndConcurrentCache (L40-65);
/// package plus imports (L1-11); impl
/// tests/support/tempcache/cache.go consts (L21-30),
/// structs (L32-42), Open (L47-96), Close (L100-123).
/// Disposition: migrate (this row ports
/// TestClosePreservesParentAndConcurrentCache to ordinary Can
/// functions; the old Go harness stays until the integrator
/// retires it after every linked row, variant, environment
/// and control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the static live baseline as the
/// green root: the package plus func names, the TempDir,
/// Open, Close, Path, Stat, IsNotExist spellings, the
/// Close-only Lstat, RemoveAll, SameFile spellings, the
/// cache prefix, marker, lease, schema names, the mkdir
/// plus file modes, the recovery bound, the Cache field
/// count, and the nil-close ok.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): modes pin str
/// to keep the 0755/0600 spellings (cache.go L55/L80/L91);
/// limit pins int 16 (L30); field count pins int 3 from
/// the Cache struct (L39-41); nil-close pins bool from the
/// nil guard (L101-103); op spellings pin the exact Go
/// identifiers (TempDir L41, Open L42/L47, Close
/// L46/L51/L53, Path L52/L59, Stat L56/L59/L62,
/// IsNotExist L56, Lstat L106, RemoveAll L114, SameFile
/// L111).
/// Facet map (static baseline): pkg-name pins tempcache
/// (test L1); func-name pins the close test (L40);
/// tempdir-op pins TempDir (L41); open-op pins Open
/// (L42/L47); close-op pins Close (L46/L51/L53);
/// path-field pins Path (L52/L59); stat-op pins Stat
/// (L56/L59/L62); is-not-exist-op pins IsNotExist (L56);
/// lstat-op pins Lstat (impl L106); remove-all-op pins
/// RemoveAll (impl L114); same-file-op pins SameFile
/// (impl L111); cache-prefix pins can-suite-cache- (impl
/// L21); marker-name pins .can-test-owner.json (impl
/// L22); lease-name pins .can-test-lease (impl L23);
/// schema-name pins can.test-suite-cache/1 (impl L24);
/// mkdir-mode pins 0755 (impl L55); file-mode pins 0600
/// (impl L80/L91); recovery-limit pins 16 (impl L30);
/// cache-field-count pins 3 (impl L39-41); nil-close-ok
/// pins true (impl L101-103).
/// Answer verdicts live in history-034-cache-semantics.can;
/// the run shape lives in history-034-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none in this file (default only); the
/// two-cache variant pins in cache-semantics.
/// Environment: no env gate; local temp dir only.
/// Logical gates SUITE/WORK/FILES/FAULT/NATIVE and C/R/N/S/A
/// identities bind at P23; no live run now. Accept gate P23
/// is unmet. Timeout 60000ms bounds the static baseline
/// probe (no Go guard exists; offline only).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23 unmet).
/// Case history/cache-close-roots checks: pkg-name,
/// func-name, tempdir-op, open-op, close-op, path-field,
/// stat-op, is-not-exist-op, lstat-op, remove-all-op,
/// same-file-op, cache-prefix, marker-name, lease-name,
/// schema-name, mkdir-mode, file-mode, recovery-limit,
/// cache-field-count, nil-close-ok.
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
